 result←object onChange arg;tracking
 tracking←16∊##.##.BitVals object ⎕VGET⊂'_style' 0 ⍝ Have they asked for continuous drag-tracking?
 result←object('Scroll'##.##.SetEvent'Change')arg ⍝ Generates a single event when Thumb changes
 :If tracking ⍝ Turn tracking on
     {}object('ThumbDrag'##.##.SetEvent'Change')arg ⍝ Generates repeated events as Thumb changes continuously while dragging
 :Else ⍝ Turn tracking off
     ⍝ Hopefully this event will run quickly enough if it's been turned off after having been turned on
     {}object('ThumbDrag'##.##.SetEvent'Change'),⎕NULL ⍝ Turn off ThumbDrag but leave 'Scroll' as-is
 :EndIf
